# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OS / editor
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.vscode/
.idea/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Vivado — project output directories
#
# Vivado regenerates all of these from the .xpr, the block design, and the
# sources in hdl/. None of it belongs in version control: the four directories
# below came to ~520 MB on this project.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.cache/
*.gen/
*.hw/
*.ioplanning/
*.ip_user_files/
*.runs/
*.sim/
.Xil/
.jobs/

# Keep curated implementation reports under vivado/reports/ (checked in
# deliberately as evidence of timing closure and resource usage), but ignore
# the raw multi-megabyte report dumps Vivado leaves in the run directories.
*_methodology_drc_routed.rpt
*_drc_routed.rpt
*_drc_opted.rpt
*_control_sets_placed.rpt
*_io_placed.rpt

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Vivado — logs, journals, crash dumps
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
vivado.jou
vivado.log
vivado_*.jou
vivado_*.log
vivado_*.str
vivado_pid*.str
*.backup.jou
*.backup.log
hs_err_pid*.log
.Vivado_Synthesis.queue.rst
.Vivado_Implementation.queue.rst
.vivado.begin.rst
.vivado.end.rst
webtalk/
tight_setup_hold_pins.txt
dfx_runtime.txt

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Synthesis / implementation artifacts
#
# Checkpoints are large and machine-specific; bitstreams are rebuildable.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.dcp
*.bit
*.bin
*.ltx
*.mmi
*.rbt
*.sysdef
*.hdf
*.xsa
*.pdi
*.bif

# Model binaries — downloaded, not committed. See models/README.md
*.xmodel
*.elf
*.tflite
*.pb
*.onnx

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Generated / packaged IP
#
# ipshared/ and the generated netlists under an IP directory are reproduced by
# Vivado when the block design is regenerated. The hand-written sources in
# hdl/ are the real design.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
ipshared/
*_sim_netlist.v
*_sim_netlist.vhdl
*_stub.v
*_stub.vhdl
*.veo
*.vho
*.sveo

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Simulation
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.wdb
*.wcfg
*.vcd
*.ghw
xsim.dir/
xvhdl.log
xvlog.log
xelab.log
xsim*.log
*.jou.bak

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PetaLinux / board images
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
images/
build/
*.dtbo
BOOT.BIN
image.ub

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Python (PS-side software)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Original source archives and unpacked working copies
#
# These are the raw handoff artifacts this repo was assembled from. The files
# that matter have been copied into hdl/, vivado/, software/ and docs/.
# Kept out of git for size; safe to delete locally once you're happy with the
# curated tree.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.zip
final_no_dpu/
AUP-ZU3-Potential Simplified/
*.docx
